Restores a verified management backup offline and revokes restored tokens

Usage: leptoskit console restore [OPTIONS] --from <FROM> --previous <PREVIOUS>

Options:
      --data <DATA>          
      --from <FROM>          
      --previous <PREVIOUS>  
      --yes                  
  -h, --help                 Print help
  -V, --version              Print version
